 *
 * The positive control for compile_fail/enum_needs_types.ct: importing
 * `hashmap::HashMapTypes` together with `hashmap::HashMap` makes all three
 * status codes visible. Without this, a compiler that simply rejected
 * `HMAP_OK` everywhere (or a change that renamed it) would keep the negative
